{"repositoryId":1375772356,"availability":"available","full":"rrgmc/karaokemachine","name":"karaokemachine","description":"A karaoke machine that behaves like a commercial home unit.","category":"Other","language":"Rust","stars":7,"forks":2,"created":"2026-09-18T11:31:54Z","updated":"2026-10-12T18:58:52Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://rrgmc.github.io/karaokemachine/","topics":["cdg","kar","karaoke","midi","rust","sdl3","soundfont","ultrastar"],"demo":"https://rrgmc.github.io/karaokemachine/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:36.511Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:36.511Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:36.511Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T19:08:36.511Z","stars":7,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A karaoke machine that behaves like a commercial home unit: pick a song by number, it plays, and the words highlight in time. It runs full-screen on a television, and any phone on the network is a remote: search the catalog, queue a song, change the key, skip.","An MP3 on its own is not a song, because it has no words in it.","It runs on Windows, macOS and Linux, on Android and a Meta Quest, and on an iPhone and an iPad. The pictures and the download are on the site, rrgmc.github.io/karaokemachine."],"features":["a MIDI file with embedded karaoke lyrics;","an MP3+G pair: an MP3 with a .cdg of the same stem beside it;","an UltraStar song: the .txt a singing game times its words in, and the MP3 it names;","an LRC song: an .lrc of timed lyrics, and the MP3 of the same name.","Five kinds of song: MIDI and KAR, video, MP3+G, UltraStar and LRC. See"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rrgmc/karaokemachine/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"3c0e4a4509f00c2b473671770d1fbbd3901167ccbdc36195978f4cd7739dc81c","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:36.753Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:08:36.753Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A kara